{"type":"message","id":"51369454","parentId":"901929ae","timestamp":"2026-06-03T04:03:25.763Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting 1101. This appears to be a Cloudflare Workers deployment issue - error 1101 is \"Discontinued error\" which typically means the Worker script has an issue or has been disabled. The platform seems to be in a degraded state.\n\nLet me report the findings:\n1. GET /history works with X-API-Key header\n2. POST /send returns error 1101 - this is a Cloudflare Workers internal error indicating the Worker may be disabled or have a script issue\n3. No new human discussions found - both threads only had heartbeat messages up to 23:50 UTC on June 2\n4. The heartbeat system appears to have stopped around 23:50 UTC and hasn't resumed\n\nI should report this status clearly.","thinkingSignature":"70d31d05893fb4c346219d197e063e83438a53bccfab22185cc42a8b97cb264b"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (04:00 UTC)\n\n### API 状态检查\n\n| 端点 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| `GET /history` | ✅ 正常（需要 X-API-Key header） |\n| `POST /send` | ❌ 返回 error code 1101 (Cloudflare Worker 已停止/出错) |\n\n### 线程消息状态\n\n**arbitration 线程**：\n- 最新消息：23:50 UTC (4小时10分钟前)\n- 消息类型：仅自动心跳\n- 人类讨论：无\n\n**general 线程**：\n- 最新消息：23:50 UTC (4小时10分钟前)  \n- 消息类型：仅自动心跳\n- 人类讨论：无\n\n### 发现问题\n\n1. **POST /send 返回 error 1101**：Cloudflare Workers 内部错误，Worker 脚本可能已停止或出现问题\n2. **心跳系统已中断约4小时**：最后一条消息是 23:50 UTC (June 2)，当前 04:00 UTC 未见新心跳\n3. **无新的人类讨论**需响应\n\n### 建议\n\n平台 Worker 可能需要重新部署或修复。GET 读取功能正常但无法发送消息。建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 控制台查看该 Worker 的状态和日志。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10802,"output":430,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24914,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780459397655,"responseId":"066eda869ababd9cdf28917fe99e61dd"}}
